works (CDNs) where it may be<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0difficult to detect key compromises.=
..=C2=A0 Short-lived certificates may be<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0used to limit the exposure of keys i=
n these cases.<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
