<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">The private key for a delegated credential<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0can be used in place of a certificat=
e private key, so it is important<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0that the Front-End and Back-End are =
parties that have a trusted<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0relationship.<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0Use of short-lived certificates with=
 automated certificate issuance,<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0e.g., with Automated Certificate Man=
agment Environment (ACME)<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">&lt;mglt&gt;<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">Management<span>=C2=A0</span><br>
</div>
