<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0signature: =C2=A0The delegation, a s=
ignature that binds the credential to<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 the end-entity certificate&#=
39;s public key as specified below.=C2=A0 The<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 signature scheme is specifie=
d by DelegatedCredential.algorithm.<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">[...]<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">4.1.1.=C2=A0 Server Authentication<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0A client which supports this specifi=
cation SHALL send a<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0&quot;delegated_credential&quot; ext=
ension in its ClientHello.=C2=A0 The body of the<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px">=C2=A0 =C2=A0extension consists of a SignatureSch=
emeList:<br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
<div style=3D"margin:0px"><br>
</div>
